OL,3,AJapan executes man who killed five in
OL,4,APachinko parlour fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FJapan has executed a man who killed
OL,7,Ffive people in a gaming parlour fire in
OL,8,F2009, making this the first time in
OL,9,Fmore than a year that the country has
OL,10,Fenacted the death sentence.
OL,12,FSunao Takami, 58, had doused the
OL,13,Fpachinko gaming parlour near his home
OL,14,Fin Osaka with gasoline and set it
OL,15,Falight, killing four customers and one
OL,16,Femployee.
OL,18,FA six-member jury and a panel of three
OL,19,Fjudges rejected the defence's argument
OL,20,Fthat Takami was mentally ill at the
OL,21,Ftime of the crime, and sentenced him to
OL,22,Fhang in 2011.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
