OL,3,AJapan executes man who killed five in
OL,4,APachinko parlour fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FJapan and the United States are the
OL,7,Fonly G7 countries that still impose
OL,8,Fcapital punishment, with death row
OL,9,Fprisoners in Japan typically being
OL,10,Fnotified of their hanging just a few
OL,11,Fhours in advance.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
